      "title": "Read before running",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "EXPERIMENTAL R2V FastH3\n\nThis keeps MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo conditioning, NOT I2V. FastH3 8-Step V2 was not distilled for Ref2VA. Multi-reference fidelity, audio and speed are unvalidated.\n\nInternal model chain: loader (+ optional LoRA) -> MiniMaxH3SigmaShift (10 / 3) -> ModelAttentionBackend (comfy kitchen attention) -> BlockSparseAttention (VSA, keep 10%, 0.2-1, min 12288, extra 256, exact_kv_and_rows) -> BasicGuider AND BasicScheduler.\n\nNeeds recent ComfyUI with those native nodes and compatible Comfy Kitchen kernels. Select your local model/encoder/VAEs and llama.cpp model/server, then choose the five reference files. Extra references are optional; disconnected image slots are renumbered consecutively. Exact audio reuse copies only Audio 1.\n\nUpstream scope: https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-8-Step-V2"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "EXPERIMENTAL R2V FastH3\n\nThis keeps MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo conditioning, NOT I2V. FastH3 8-Step V2 was not distilled for Ref2VA. Multi-reference fidelity, audio and speed are unvalidated.\n\nInternal model chain: loader (+ optional LoRA) -> MiniMaxH3SigmaShift (10 / 3) -> ModelAttentionBackend (comfy kitchen attention) -> BlockSparseAttention (VSA, keep 10%, 0.2-1, min 12288, extra 256, exact_kv_and_rows) -> BasicGuider AND BasicScheduler.\n\nNeeds recent ComfyUI with those native nodes and compatible Comfy Kitchen kernels. Select your local model/encoder/VAEs and llama.cpp model/server, then choose the five reference files. Extra references are optional; disconnected image slots are renumbered consecutively. Exact audio reuse copies only Audio 1.\n\nUpstream scope: https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-8-Step-V2"
      }
    }
